---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AboutPlainLead from '../../components/AboutPlainLead.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={"RCE-VC: Law of Version Control"}
  description={"About: RCE-VC states a Law of Version Control. At openIE-dev/rce-vc commit aba99fce (49 offline tests, including rcevc-keys Rust/Python item splitting), 100,000-unit admission takes 69.7–73.6 µs and 317–365 µJ L3 reported_j on Apple M5 Max (measured_j = None)."}
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Research study · draft · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      RCE-VC: Law of Version Control
    </h1>
    <AboutPlainLead id="rce-vc" />
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      RCE-VC is a version-control reference in the public repository <code>openIE-dev/rce-vc</code>, commit <code>aba99fce</code> (13 November 2026). It admits a change into one canonical, name-free repository state when a named checker accepts the post-state, and otherwise refuses it with a recorded reason. Changes whose dependency closures do not meet are admitted without coordination. A stated cost ranks admissible results, and accepted results, including resolved conflicts, are reused. The workspace ships <code>rcevc-core</code> (persistent Merkle HAMT plus <code>assure</code> boundary), <code>rcevc-keys</code> (tree-sitter top-level item splitting for Rust and Python), and <code>rcevc-proj-git</code> (ordinary Git history in and out). It shares framing with the Reality Code Engine (a Form, a total step, a hash-chained log, name-free keys, and a gear ladder with the model last); it is not built on the Reality Code Engine language.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray mb-3">What the study claims and what it does not</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <li>It quotes the Law of Version Control once, as the reference states it, and clarifies that the reference is separate from the Reality Code Engine language.</li>
        <li>It reports milestones M0, M1 and M2 at commit <code>aba99fce</code> (<code>49</code> offline tests across <code>rcevc-core</code>, <code>rcevc-keys</code>, and <code>rcevc-proj-git</code>), covering propositions VC1 to VC5, Rust/Python top-level item keys, and Git round-trip checks.</li>
        <li>On Apple M5 Max at <code>100,000</code> units (<code>10,000</code> modules), admission takes <code>69.7–73.6 µs</code> wall time and <code>317–365 µJ</code> per-process kernel <code>ri_energy_nj</code> (<code>L3</code> <code>reported_j</code>, genesis <code>1.24 s</code>), kept strictly separate from the in-repository <code>est_uj</code> integer cost table.</li>
        <li>It does not claim an external wall-plug or rail power reading (<code>measured_j = None</code>, <code>board_metered = false</code>), a result on Merge-Bench or 1,000-repository Git corpora, TypeScript splitting, packfiles, leases, or Wasmtime checker sandboxing.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <figure class="mt-10 glass-card p-4 fig-wide">
      <a class="fig-zoom" href="/figures/rce-vc/swarm-and-timing.svg" aria-label="Enlarge figure"><img src="/figures/rce-vc/swarm-and-timing.svg" alt="Measured admission-path shares for a 1,280-submission swarm, and measured wall time per submission from 400 units to 100,000 units, on the reference build. Not an energy figure." class="fig-img w-full rounded bg-white" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a>
      <figcaption class="mt-3 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">Path shares and wall times printed for the baseline reference build (with Apple M5 Max <code>69.7–73.6 µs</code> and <code>317–365 µJ</code> <code>L3</code> <code>reported_j</code> at <code>aba99fce</code> reported in Section 7.3).</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/rce-vc/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read → /papers/rce-vc/
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/rce-vc.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/openIE-dev/rce-vc/tree/aba99fcec4414a32bff30ab075668350d3fb80bf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan border border-brand-cyan/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-cyan/10 transition-colors">
        Repository: openIE-dev/rce-vc (aba99fce)
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
